<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose - May 21 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose - May 21 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MAY 14</p>
<p> (Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............813,300 up.....3,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......721,000 down...1,300</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......555,800 up.......700</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MAY 21</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....854,370 up.....2,739</p>
<p> Financial companies.......661,339 up.....2,516</p>
<p> New York business loans....46,272 up.......191</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......46,016 up.......199</p>
</text>
